REFEREE 4 BLIND RESULTS (written before opening anything in /home/agent2/drum/ except the brief; exact-prediction.md not yet opened either)
Method: load = 40 equal-width rings, piecewise constant. Search: finite-volume tridiagonal solver (400 cells, analytic gradients),
sequential-LP trust region + SLSQP minimax polish, 35-125 starts each (discs, rings, random), 75 s per case; best start re-polished on 1600 cells.
Reported 'exact' miss = piecewise Bessel J/Y matching (root-found), independent of the finite-volume grid.

